What we are looking for:

 * Conduct penetration tests on the company's infrastructure and applications;
 * Identify vulnerabilities;
 * Model attacks;
 * Prepare reports with recommendations.




Our expectations:

 * Experience in pentesting;
 * Knowledge of networks, operating systems, and tools (Nmap, Metasploit, Burp Suite, etc.);
 * Understanding of methodologies (OWASP, PTES);
 * English level of at least B1+ or higher.




Will be a plus:

 * Certifications (OSCP, CEH);
 * Knowledge of modern AI tools and experience using them in work.




We Offer:

☑︎ Learning and Development:

 * A wide range of diverse projects in industries such as FinTech, Medicine, Entertainment, eCommerce, Gaming, Artificial Intelligence, and more;
 * A broad technology stack with the opportunity to switch between technologies;
 * Individual growth plans and regular reviews of conditions (project roles, salary level);
 * Preparation for interviews with international clients in English.




☑︎ Work Environment:

 * On-site work format;
 * Spacious and comfortable workstations;
 * Detailed onboarding: introduction to the team, processes, and policies, office tour, welcome card;
 * Cozy kitchens, game rooms, coworking spaces, and lounge areas.




☑︎ Additional Perks:

 * Voluntary health insurance;
 * Discounts from partner companies (from pizzerias and bookstores to electronics stores).




