Hungry for challenges? Join a group with innovation at its heart and contribute to the automotive revolution!

OPmobility is a world-leading provider of innovative solutions for a unique, safer and more sustainable mobility experience. Innovation-driven since its creation, the Group develops and produces intelligent exterior systems, customized complex modules, lighting systems, clean energy systems and electrification solutions for all mobility companies. With a €11.4 billion economic revenue in 2023, a global network of 152 plants and 40 R&D centers, OPmobility relies on its 40,300 employees to meet the challenges of transforming mobility.

Our ambition? Provide automakers with cutting-edge equipment and solutions to develop tomorrow’s clean and connected car.




The position is located in Cracow, Poland.




Reporting directly to the Global Indirect Purchasing Manager - Hardware & Cybersecurity




The Global IT Commodity Buyer - Hardware & Cyber:

 * Proposes the commodity strategy and manages the supply base and relationship according to OP purchasing policy;
 * Follows and reports the supplier’s performance (quality, cost, time) and financial health of suppliers;
 * Leads the suppliers sourcing process in the respect of the procedures and promotes the technical savings proposed by the suppliers;
 * Leads negotiation with the suppliers and internal customers and is responsible for contractualizations;
 * Leads each time necessary the problem-solving process;
 * Commits & manages his portfolio in line with budget;




Requirements:

 * 3+ years of experience in an IT purchasing department;
 * Master Degree within purchasing, logistics, IT or equivalent;
 * Experience in negotiations and contractual negotiation;
 * Project management skills and stakeholder management;
 * Experience from international working envoirment;
 * Fluent English (French will be an asset but is not mandatory);
 * Customer-oriented approach and multitasking;




Benefits:

 * Competitive salary;
 * Employment stability;
 * Private Life Insurance;
 * Social Fund;
 * Healthcare;
 * Other Social Services (e.g Multisport);




As a responsible company, OPmobility pays particular attention to diversity and equality within its teams and the Group commits to treat all job applications equally.
